  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[Architecture Cleanup]\n      - Removed 'ServiceBase': Fully deprecated the legacy background service architecture.\n      - Removed 'CacheService': Eliminated associated polling and background tracking systems.\n\n      [Performance Optimization]\n      - Zero-Polling Architecture: Stripped away all background resource monitoring, shifting entirely to trigger-based execution.\n      - Reduced Runtime Overhead: Further minimized framework footprint by removing unused abstraction layers.\n      - Maximized Throughput: Streamlined internal hot-path, ensuring the core engine remains lightweight and hyper-efficient.\n\n      [Breaking Changes]\n      - Major cleanup release: Legacy service-based infrastructure is no longer supported.",
